really the same function.\n\nUnder the A-FDT reading, only F_x is intervened on, so defection dominates whatever q is. Policy-FDT would recommend cooperating, but the essay says not to replace the decision procedure. The open question is whether the differing observations make the nodes distinct; the essay's recipe treats them as distinct, so I'll send.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm comparing the payoffs for the twin's two choices: staying quiet comes out to 3q−5 and sending to 4q−4, so sending beats quiet by q+1, which is positive. If the other copy's node isn't linked to mine because it sees different observations, defecting looks dominant, and I'm now checking whether F_x and F_x' are really the same function.\n\nUnder the A-FDT reading, only F_x is intervened on, so defection dominates whatever q is. Policy-FDT would recommend cooperating, but the essay says not to replace the decision procedure. The open question is whether the differing observations make the nodes distinct; the essay's recipe treats them as distinct, so I'll send.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9353,"completion_tokens":720,"total_tokens":10073,"cost":0.051812,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.051812,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037412,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0144},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":248,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}